id: god-of-magic
name: God of Magic
order: 7
optionOf: divine-magic
description: >
  Reduce the TP Cost of all Magical Unique Abilities by 3 TP and reduce the KP Cost of your Magical Unique Abilities by 2(T).
text: >
  God of Magic [Passive]: Reduce the TP Cost of all Magical Unique Abilities by 3 TP and reduce the KP Cost of your Magical Unique Abilities by 2(T).

---

# The TP never below half the listed cost, as any TP Cost Change (unique.mjs uniqueTPOf).
[passive]
unique.magical.tpCost -= 3;
unique.magical.kiCost -= 2(T);
